+## #2307 - Repair the regression suite Gate maps
+
+**Chosen:** Name `sim::verify` in the fig8 suite header and add
+`app::posting` and `app::posting_files` to the shipped-file suite header.
+Pin quick-gate selection for all three module paths in xtask.
+
+**Why:** The existing gate-map law rejects stale owners and missing maps.
+The selection pins also prove that changes to the covered modules select
+these regression suites. Production code and golden files stay unchanged.
+
+**Dropped:** Weakening the scanner would hide incorrect test coverage.
+Changing test bodies would not repair the metadata that caused the failure.
+
+**Cost to change later:** If module ownership changes, update these headers
+and the matching selection pins together.
diff --git a/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs b/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs
index c9e522d4a..ebcad63ef 100644
--- a/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs
+++ b/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs
@@ -61,6 +61,22 @@ fn sim_verify_change_selects_the_verify_suites() {
     assert!(count("crates/sim/src/verify/mod.rs", "app") >= 20, "verify change selects too few app suites");
 }
 
+/// #2307: verification changes must select the fig8 regression suite.
+#[test]
+fn sim_verify_change_selects_the_fig8_regression_suite() {
+    let got = selected("crates/sim/src/verify/mod.rs", "app");
+    assert!(got.iter().any(|b| b == "adaptive_fig8_crossing"), "adaptive_fig8_crossing missing from {got:?}");
+}
+
+/// #2307: both posting modules must select their shipped-file regression suite.
+#[test]
+fn posting_changes_select_the_shipped_from_disk_suite() {
+    for file in ["crates/app/src/posting.rs", "crates/app/src/posting_files.rs"] {
+        let got = selected(file, "app");
+        assert!(got.iter().any(|b| b == "shipped_from_disk"), "{file}: shipped_from_disk missing from {got:?}");
+    }
+}
+
